    "branch derives from the child request digest (job.branch is fixed at create_job, BEFORE the attempt id is minted at claim; the runtime has no Job.branch update API) - the brief's 'first 8 chars of attempt id' would be unknowable at the only moment branch is set",
    "fabric placement intent ids are slash-free tokens (fabric_placement_policy _require_token): the intent projects root_ref/immediate_parent_run_ref by stripping their refs//parents/ prefixes; the ChildExecutionRequest keeps the exact refs",
    "model selection is harness-fixed through the spec's model field; the scratch route row is a provider descriptor with no alias->model mapping, so no route->T3 modelSelection translation exists yet",
    "launch arguments (projectId + workspaceStrategy/worktree) ride the production T3McpToolPort launch_arguments seam via port_factory; the default port construction in compose_t3_native_adapter does not pass them",
    "return delivery is an honest typed REFUSAL (NATIVE_SESSION_UNAVAILABLE): the Hermes Secretary seam is R9-BLOCKED; no sink is invented"
  ],
